for (const [en,id] of [["Editorial & data standards","Standar Editorial & Data"],["Lawful sources","Sumber yang sah"],["Only information gathered lawfully and reusable under applicable licenses and terms will be published.","Hanya informasi yang diperoleh secara sah dan dapat digunakan ulang sesuai lisensi serta ketentuan yang berlaku yang dipublikasikan."],["Fact vs interpretation","Fakta vs interpretasi"],["Confirmed facts, attributed statements, analytical assessment and unknowns are distinguished.","Fakta terkonfirmasi, pernyataan yang diatribusikan, penilaian analitis, dan hal yang belum diketahui dibedakan dengan jelas."],["Confidentiality","Kerahasiaan"],["Private client work, restricted records and confidential interviews are excluded unless explicit rights permit publication.","Pekerjaan klien privat, dokumen terbatas, dan wawancara rahasia tidak dipublikasikan tanpa izin yang jelas."],["Financial boundaries","Batasan finansial"],["We do not provide personalized securities recommendations, portfolio management or regulated investment advisory services.","Kami tidak menyediakan rekomendasi efek personal, pengelolaan portofolio, maupun jasa penasihat investasi yang diatur."],["Transparency","Transparansi"],["Records will identify source, methodology, limitations and date of review.","Setiap data mencantumkan sumber, metodologi, keterbatasan, dan tanggal peninjauan."],["Source-led monitoring","Pemantauan berbasis sumber"],["Dataset status: not published","Status dataset: belum dipublikasikan"],["Search verified records once available…","Cari data terverifikasi setelah tersedia…"],["Search records","Cari data"],["Project / Indicator","Proyek / Indikator"],["Sector / Region","Sektor / Wilayah"],["Evidence status","Status bukti"],["Reference date","Tanggal acuan"],["Source","Sumber"],["No verified public records yet. This is a design preview, not a live dashboard.","Belum ada data publik yang terverifikasi. Ini adalah pratinjau desain, bukan dashboard langsung."],["Implementation discipline.","Disiplin implementasi."],["Public announcements do not establish realized expenditure. Future records will include traceable primary sources and clear verification dates.","Pengumuman publik tidak membuktikan pengeluaran investasi aktual. Data selanjutnya akan dilengkapi sumber primer yang dapat ditelusuri dan tanggal verifikasi."],["Daily historical spot observations from FRED/EIA. The numbers above show their actual observation dates; delayed data, not live trading quotations.","Observasi harga spot historis harian dari FRED/EIA. Angka menampilkan tanggal observasi sebenarnya; ini data tertunda, bukan kutipan perdagangan langsung."],["Henry Hub daily spot observation is shown above when the dated feed is available. International LNG benchmarks are separate assessments.","Harga spot harian Henry Hub ditampilkan ketika data bertanggal tersedia. Patokan LNG internasional dinilai secara terpisah."],["Latest recorded historical observation displayed above","Observasi historis terbaru yang tersedia"],["World Bank Pink Sheet reference; not the same product, quality or mechanism as Indonesian HBA.","Acuan Pink Sheet Bank Dunia; jenis produk, mutu, dan mekanismenya berbeda dari HBA Indonesia."],["ICP is published by Indonesia's Ministry of Energy and Mineral Resources; not an intraday oil price.","ICP diterbitkan oleh Kementerian ESDM, bukan harga minyak intrahari."],["Indonesian biodiesel reference-price announcement; report volume units and transport-cost treatment.","Pengumuman harga acuan biodiesel Indonesia; perhatikan satuan volume dan biaya transportasi."],["official published Indonesian bioethanol reference prices; not physical biomass or wood pellet prices.","Harga acuan bioetanol yang dipublikasikan pemerintah; bukan harga biomassa atau pelet kayu."],["feedstock, region, moisture content, contract and calorific value determine pricing. SLI will publish only clearly specified comparables.","Harga ditentukan oleh bahan baku, daerah, kadar air, kontrak, dan nilai kalor. SLI hanya menampilkan perbandingan dengan spesifikasi yang jelas."],["Geopolitical Energy Watch","Pemantauan Energi Geopolitik"],["Evidence-led risk monitoring · editorial review required","Pemantauan risiko berbasis bukti · perlu kajian editorial"],["Global-to-Indonesia transmission pathways","Jalur transmisi risiko global ke Indonesia"],["What matters for Indonesia","Hal penting bagi Indonesia"],["Strait of Hormuz / Middle East:","Selat Hormuz / Timur Tengah:"],["crude flows, shipping risk, freight and import costs.","Arus minyak mentah, risiko pelayaran, ongkos angkut, dan biaya impor."],["Russia / Black Sea:","Rusia / Laut Hitam:"],["changes in crude and refined product trade flows, sanctions compliance and shipping routes.","Perubahan perdagangan minyak mentah dan BBM, kepatuhan sanksi, serta jalur pelayaran."],["Indo-Pacific / LNG:","Indo-Pasifik / LNG:"],["Asian gas supply, shipping disruptions and regional power-sector exposure.","Pasokan gas Asia, gangguan pengiriman, dan eksposur sektor listrik kawasan."],["Global coal and carbon policies:","Kebijakan batubara dan karbon global:"],["thermal-coal demand, Indonesian export revenues, electricity tariffs and transition investment.","Permintaan batubara termal, pendapatan ekspor Indonesia, tarif listrik, dan investasi transisi."],["Live monitoring architecture","Arsitektur pemantauan berkala"],["Sources, not unverified headlines","Sumber terverifikasi, bukan sekadar judul berita"],["Currently:","Saat ini:"],["analytical watchlist and direct source links. This is not an automated live event feed.","Daftar pantauan analitis dan tautan sumber langsung. Ini bukan aliran kejadian langsung otomatis."],["Next:","Selanjutnya:"],["machine-readable alerts for new publications; human review of claims, dates and Indonesia-specific transmission before dashboard publication.","Notifikasi terstruktur atas publikasi baru; klaim, tanggal, dan dampak khusus Indonesia ditinjau manusia sebelum tayang."],["Global Geopolitical Energy Intelligence","Intelijen Energi Geopolitik Global"],["Automated news discovery · every ~3 hours","Penelusuran berita otomatis · sekitar tiap 3 jam"],["Discovery vs verification:","Penemuan vs verifikasi:"],["The automated feed displays attributed news leads, not independently verified incidents. Indexed date is the news discovery time, not necessarily the event date. Impact analysis is conditional. Historical incident timeline below is a separate editorial snapshot.","Umpan otomatis menyajikan temuan berita beserta sumbernya, bukan insiden yang sudah diverifikasi secara independen. Tanggal indeks adalah waktu berita ditemukan, bukan selalu tanggal kejadian. Analisis dampak bersifat kondisional. Kronologi historis merupakan kajian editorial terpisah."],["Geopolitical Energy Radar","Radar Energi Geopolitik"],["Latest attributed reports","Berita terbaru beserta sumber"],["Awaiting first automated scan","Menunggu pemindaian otomatis pertama"],["Region / theme","Wilayah / tema"],["All developments","Semua perkembangan"],["Search reports","Cari laporan"],["Run the geopolitical monitoring workflow to load the first sourced reports.","Jalankan alur pemantauan geopolitik untuk memuat laporan dengan sumber."],["Analytical lens: event trigger → energy transmission channel → Indonesia exposure → indicator to validate. This is not an automated AI-generated incident verification service.","Kerangka analitis: pemicu kejadian → jalur transmisi energi → eksposur Indonesia → indikator untuk diverifikasi. Ini bukan layanan verifikasi insiden otomatis oleh AI."],["Geopolitical Energy Incident Timeline","Kronologi Insiden Energi Geopolitik"],["Research snapshot · 15 October 2026","Ringkasan riset · 15 Oktober 2026"],["Evidence distinction:","Pemisahan bukti:"],["reported incidents and their potential market impacts are separate. Damage to an office does not prove refinery or oilfield production losses. This is not a real-time event feed.","Laporan insiden dan dampak potensial terhadap pasar adalah dua hal berbeda. Kerusakan kantor tidak membuktikan gangguan produksi kilang atau ladang minyak. Data ini bukan umpan peristiwa langsung."],["Energy channel:","Jalur dampak energi:"],["Indonesia channel:","Jalur dampak bagi Indonesia:"],["Geopolitical-to-Energy Transmission","Transmisi Risiko Geopolitik ke Energi"],["Analytical pathways, not quantified forecasts","Jalur analisis, bukan proyeksi kuantitatif"],["Infrastructure strike →","Serangan infrastruktur →"],["Maritime disruption →","Gangguan pelayaran →"],["Escalation without production loss →","Eskalasi tanpa gangguan produksi →"],["National & international energy resilience indices","Indeks ketahanan energi nasional & internasional"],["Different frameworks · not directly comparable","Kerangka berbeda · tidak dapat dibandingkan langsung"],["National Energy Security Index (IKE)","Indeks Ketahanan Energi Nasional (IKE)"],["Explore official 4A scorecard + supplemental Sustainability lens ↗","Lihat rincian 4A resmi + lensa keberlanjutan tambahan ↗"],["Status: Tahan (Resilient)","Status: Tahan"],["Energy Equity","Keadilan Akses Energi"],["Environmental Sustainability","Keberlanjutan Lingkungan"],["Methodology note:","Catatan metodologi:"],["Historical import trends","Tren impor historis"],["Annual values · USD billion","Nilai tahunan · miliar USD"],["Crude oil vs refined petroleum product imports","Impor minyak mentah vs produk BBM"],["Values reflect customs-based imports, not quantities or energy dependency ratios. Import spending changes with both prices and volumes.","Angka menunjukkan nilai impor menurut bea cukai, bukan volume atau rasio ketergantungan energi. Belanja impor berubah karena harga dan volume."],["Crude oil + petroleum products","Minyak mentah + produk BBM"],["Crude oil only","Hanya minyak mentah"],["Petroleum products only","Hanya produk BBM"],["Grouped bars","Batang berkelompok"],["Line chart","Grafik garis"],["Click a bar or point to see its exact annual value.","Klik batang atau titik untuk melihat nilai tahunan tepatnya."],["Crude oil (US$bn)","Minyak mentah (miliar US$)"],["Petroleum products (US$bn)","Produk BBM (miliar US$)"],["Analytical interpretation · not investment advice","Interpretasi analitis · bukan nasihat investasi"],["Priority monitoring questions","Pertanyaan prioritas pemantauan"],["Decision-support framework","Kerangka dukungan keputusan"],["Energy exposure","Eksposur energi"],["External supply and price shocks","Guncangan pasokan dan harga eksternal"],["Even falling dollar import values do not necessarily demonstrate stronger energy security. Track import volumes, prices and domestic output separately.","Penurunan nilai impor dalam dolar tidak otomatis menunjukkan ketahanan energi yang lebih baik. Pantau volume impor, harga, dan produksi domestik secara terpisah."],["Price and currency sensitivity","Sensitivitas harga dan nilai tukar"],["Industrial reliability","Keandalan industri"],["Grid development as investment enabler","Pengembangan jaringan listrik sebagai penopang investasi"],["New smelters, data centers and manufacturing zones depend on reliable electricity and transmission, not generation capacity alone.","Smelter, pusat data, dan kawasan industri baru bergantung pada keandalan pasokan serta transmisi listrik, bukan sekadar kapasitas pembangkit."],["Fiscal exposure","Eksposur fiskal"],["Global oil shocks and budgets","Guncangan minyak global dan anggaran"],["Evaluate oil prices alongside exchange rates, administered energy prices and public spending to assess fiscal transmission channels.","Nilai dampak fiskal dengan memperhatikan harga minyak, kurs, harga energi yang diatur, dan belanja pemerintah secara bersama-sama."],["Policy watch","Pantauan kebijakan"],["Implementation over announcements","Pelaksanaan lebih penting dari pengumuman"],["Monitor commissioning of gas infrastructure, power projects and renewable investments, with milestone evidence rather than headline capacity targets.","Pantau uji operasi infrastruktur gas, proyek pembangkit, dan investasi energi terbarukan berdasarkan bukti pencapaian, bukan sekadar target kapasitas yang diumumkan."]]) window.SLI_TRANSLATIONS_ID.set(en,id);

